  "reason": "Select only model_design because the proposed shallow causal branch belongs entirely within NextItNet and all host components are frozen. Sparse histories motivate a direct path for recent transitions, but the current validation HR@10 of 0.665 does not establish excessive depth as a bottleneck. Historical residual-scaling successes favor conservative initialization, while failed depth aggregation and positional ablations support preserving the current backbone and isolating the proposed branch.",
